  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.前往法兰城里谢里雅堡与管理员（35.50）对话，获得【联络信】。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "2.夜晚前往哥拉尔城镇，出西门至（148.402）处与狂暴的翼龙对话，传送至龙神之里。",
      "type": "timed-teleport",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "◆夜晚若持有【神眼】可看懂狂暴的翼龙说的话",
      "type": "optional-language-item",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "3.与长老（42.50）对话，获得【通行证】。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "4.与护卫队长（57.44）对话，获得【救急包裹】。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "5.与士兵对话，进入矿洞。",
      "type": "maze-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "◆矿洞为随机迷宫；魔物为Lv.40+黄蝎、史莱姆、迷你蝙蝠",
      "type": "encounter-area",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "6.通过右侧传送石进入东侧矿洞，寻找迷宫内随机出现的矿工并与之对话，获得【矿石包。A】",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "7.通过左侧传送石进入西侧矿洞，通过随机迷宫至底层与狂暴的史莱姆对话，进入战斗。",
      "type": "battle-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "◆BOSS：Lv.50狂暴的史莱姆*10",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "8.战斗胜利后与矿工对话，获得【矿石包B】并传送至矿洞。",
      "type": "post-battle-item",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "9.与矿工对话，交出【救急包裹】、【矿石包A】、【矿石包B】获得【矿石包】。",
      "type": "combined-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "10.返回龙神之里与护卫队长对话，交出【矿石包】获得【证明信】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "11.与巫女（77.31）对话，获得【小瓶湖水】并传送到龙神幻境。",
      "type": "teleport-and-item",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "◆龙神幻境途中会经过三个分岔路口；走法顺序为下→上→上",
      "type": "route-sequence",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "12.与发狂的树精领主（144.47）对话进入战斗，战斗胜利后获得【灵树树枝】并传送至龙神之里。",
      "type": "battle-and-item",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "13.与巫女对话，交出【灵树树枝】获得【祭司火把】。通过后方楼梯进入龙神之渊。",
      "type": "exchange-and-maze",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "◆龙神之渊为随机迷宫",
      "type": "maze-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "14.通过随机迷宫与邪恶的哈比对话进入战斗。战斗胜利后与卫兵对话获得【敌人的情报】并传送回龙神之里。",
      "type": "battle-and-item",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "15.与村长对话，获得【隐藏通路的钥匙】。通过村长家进入龙神之所。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        20
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "16.与邪灵祭司对话，进入战斗。战斗胜利后与龙神使者对话，获得【腐化之卵】。",
      "type": "battle-and-item",
      "sourceLines": [
        21
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "17.与暴躁的飞龙对话，传送至贝尼恰斯火山。",
      "type": "teleport-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        22
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "18.调查凸起的岩浆，获得【被净化的卵】，任务完结。",
      "type": "completion-item",
      "sourceLines": [
        23
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "text": "◆【被净化的卵】24小时后双击可以使用，将随机发生/获得：LV.1幼生神龙、LV.1风龙蜥、遇敌（LV.19蜥蜴武士*1）、净化失败（什么都没有）",
      "type": "timed-random-use",
      "sourceLines": [
        24
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "text": "◆身上只有一个【被净化的卵】时才可开启，多余的将无法使用",
      "type": "inventory-count-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        25
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    }
  ],
